   "id": 10350562148450,
   "title": "Opus 2 Conical Burr Grinder",
   "handle": "opus-2-conical-burr-grinder",
   "body_html": "<div id=\"summary\" class=\"inline-richtext my-md p text-foreground md:pr-2xl\">\n<p>Perfect for espresso, Opus 2 is a precision electric coffee grinder for every method. It moves seamlessly between brew methods to deliver consistent grind results across the full range. 48 mm conical burrs and a smooth side dial give you the control to fine-tune your coffee with intention, whether you're dialing in espresso, brewing pour-over, or preparing cold brew.</p>\n</div>",
